{
  "version": 1,
  "createdAt": "2026-11-03",
  "notes": [
    "Synthetic messages only. Expected outcomes were written before the first run and must not be edited to fit results.",
    "Expectations describe what a careful order-desk clerk would read from the message, not what the current matcher does.",
    "Units: peti/case/carton/box/dabba = case; packet/pkt/nag/piece = piece; no unit word = unknown (must be flagged, never guessed).",
    "sku: an exact SKU code; null = the line must abstain (no product); anyOf = genuinely ambiguous, any listed SKU is acceptable only if the line is flagged for review and the listed SKUs are offered.",
    "mustFlag: the line must be marked for review (an issue, or a confidence band below high).",
    "stock: the issue server pricing must raise for this line (OUT_OF_STOCK or EXCEEDS_STOCK).",
    "historyPreferred: the expected SKU is whichever of these the shop has ordered most often (computed from the seeded history before the run)."
  ],
